  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v2.0.9 (patch)\n\nChanges since v2.0.8:\n\n- Combine the nested input-not-handled check [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Give the pending read up when a run ends, so the next key is not swallowed [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Wrap text inside a border or a horizontal stack to the width it gets [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- test: cover OffsetConsoleProvider and invisible elements in Render ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Move the control-character helper and its provider tests to the end of their files ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: draw an element at the position passed to IConsoleProvider.Render [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: expand tabs and replace control characters in text before measuring and drawing [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
